'''Saki Matsuga & Doge''' (松賀咲＆わんこ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Saki Matsuga & Doge
|image = E 403.png
|appearance = [[Get On! Kyoto City Subway Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 800円 - 3,160円
}}

==Enemy==
Although she may look small, she has the highest stats of the three enemies of the collaboration event. She sports high speed and health plus a 100% chance to [[Weaken|weaken]] units' attack power by 50%. Her weaknesses are her low attack power, sluggish attack rate and low range.

